{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CghrkNzV5KgpzUKkEnAaV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01B7g1p1ZXgULZCBZn6NeBDb","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"pwd; node - <<'EOF'\nconst fs=require('fs');let s=fs.readFileSync('my-3d2dge.js','utf8');\nconst rep=(a,b)=>{ if(!s.includes(a)) throw new Error('missing '+a.slice(0,60)); s=s.replace(a,b); };\nrep(\"const HOOKS = { input: [], step: [], enter: [], draw: [], rot: null, frame: null, pose: null, pause: null }, FADES = {};\",\n \"const HOOKS = { input: [], step: [], enter: [], draw: [], rot: null, frame: null, pose: null, pause: null }, FADES = {};\\nE.HOOKS = HOOKS;   // MASH TV PATCH P1: the game switches every player's input preset before the Shell reads navigation\");\nrep(\"glyphs: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Button symbols', type: 'select', value: 'auto', options: [['auto', 'Auto'], ['xbox', 'Xbox'], ['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['nintendo', 'Nintendo'], ['generic', 'Positions']], apply: (g, v) => { g.input.glyphs = v; } },\",\n \"glyphs: { group: 'Controller', label: 'Button symbols', type: 'select', value: 'playstation', options: [['playstation', 'PlayStation'], ['xbox', 'Xbox']], apply: (g, v) => { for (const I of g._players || [g.input]) I.glyphs = v; g._glyphs = v; } },   // MASH TV PATCH P2: PlayStation by default, Xbox option, every player\");\nrep(\"  _init() {\\n    if (this.ctx || this.failed) return this.ctx;\",\n \"  get bus() { this._init(); return this._sfxBus; }   // MASH TV PATCH P4: the effects bus, for the game's own voices (volume and mute)\\n  _init() {\\n    if (this.ctx || this.failed) return this.ctx;\");\nrep(\"enter(score, mode = '', done) { this.entry = { score, mode, name: [0, 0, 0], i: 0, done, t: 0 }; this.game.input.consumeAll(); }\",\n \"enter(score, mode = '', done, input) { const I = input || this.game.input; this.entry = { score, mode, name: [0, 0, 0], i: 0, done, t: 0, input: I }; I.consumeAll(); }   // MASH TV PATCH P3: each player's own input\");\nrep(\"    const I = this.game.input, e = this.entry, tap = clicked(I);\\n    if (e) {\",\n \"    const e = this.entry, I = (e && e.input) || this.game.input, tap = clicked(this.game.input);   // MASH TV PATCH P3\\n    if (e) {\");\nrep(\"const yes = I.pressed('start') || I.pressed('confirm') || !!tap,\",\n \"const yes = (this.game.players || [I]).some(q => q.pressed('start') || q.pressed('confirm')) || !!tap,   /* MASH TV PATCH P3: any player continues */\");\n// P2b: joined players inherit glyphs\nrep(\"  q.lastDevice = q.device; if (q.pad !== null) { q.tick(0); q.consumeAll(); }\",\n \"  q.lastDevice = q.device; q.glyphs = this._glyphs || this.input.glyphs; if (q.pad !== null) { q.tick(0); q.consumeAll(); }   // (MASH TV PATCH P2: a joining player inherits the button symbols)\");\nfs.writeFileSync('my-3d2dge.js',s);console.log('patched');\nEOF\ncat > PATCHES.md <<'EOF'\n# Engine patches (MASH TV)\n\nEach patch is marked `MASH TV PATCH Pn` in `my-3d2dge.js` (v0.85.2, commit 4390a98).\n\n| # | Patch | Why |\n|---|---|---|\n| P1 | `E.HOOKS = HOOKS` right after `HOOKS` is declared | The game switches every player's input preset each step, before the Shell reads navigation: arrows aim in play but navigate in menus. |\n| P2 | The `glyphs` setting defaults to `playstation`, offers PlayStation or Xbox, applies to every `game.players` input; a player who joins later inherits it | TASK.md wants PlayStation glyphs by default with an Xbox option; stock default is `auto` and only P1 was updated. |\n| P3 | `E.Arcade.enter(score, mode, done, input)` reads the given input; `continue()` accepts a press from any player | In co-op each player enters their own initials, and anyone may continue. |\n| P4 | `get bus()` on the audio object returns the effects bus | The Babble voices go through the effects bus to obey volume and mute. |\nEOF","description":"Apply engine patches and write PATCHES.md"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"conta